#: build/index.js:121 src/components/HowItWorks.js:32
msgid ""
"Measurements are taken when someone visits a page that hasn’t been measured "
"in the last week."
msgstr ""
"Metingen worden gedaan zodra iemand een pagina bezoekt die in de afgelopen "
"week nog niet gemeten is."

